ays-visible sidebar form increases leads", "variants": ["No sidebar form (CTA to dedicated page)", "Sidebar form on landing page", "Slide-in form after 50% scroll"], "metric": "Lead capture rate"}, {"test_id": "CTA-005", "name": "Exit Intent Offer Type", "hypothesis": "Specific discount outperforms generic newsletter signup", "variants": ["'Get 10% off your first event'", "'Download our sample menu'", "'Free consultation call'"], "metric": "Exit capture rate"}], "anti_patterns_friction_points": {"avoid_these": ["Generic 'Click Here' or 'Submit' buttons without context", "CTAs that blend into background (low contrast)", "Too many competing CTAs in same viewport (>3)", "Forms requiring >5 fields before showing value", "No phone number option for mobile users", "Hidden pricing until form submission", "Auto-playing video with sound covering CTAs", "Pop-ups blocking CTAs within 5 seconds", "CTAs below fold without clear scroll indication", "Broken links or 404s on CTA destinations"]}}